('f_shear_027','m_shear','X @eshear, measured 2026-09-03: 123,009 followers, 1,193 following, 48,976 posts, 129,347 likes, 2,109 media items, joined 2007-03-11, location "SF", website softmax.com, individually verified. (The roster''s figure is 123,007 from the same endpoint the same day — a drift of two, same band, not a re-baseline.)','self_published','subject_authored','https://api.fxtwitter.com/eshear','api.fxtwitter.com','2026-09-03','2026-09-04T01:45:00Z',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'run_ingest_shear_20260903'),

