('f_shear_051','m_shear','Instagram RESOLVES, and not the way the brief expected. Read on the operator''s logged-in Chrome: instagram.com/eshear/ is "Sorry, this page isn''t available" — the account does not exist. instagram.com/emmettshear/ is a real, public, non-empty profile: display name "Emmett Shear", 4 posts, 11 followers, 1 following, category "Entrepreneur", bio "CEO of Softmax | Entrepreneur / Co-founder, Justin.tv & Twitch / Former Interim CEO, OpenAI", external link softmax.com/about. They are NOT identical shells and the pair is not indeterminate.','self_published','subject_authored','https://www.instagram.com/emmettshear/','instagram.com','2026-09-04','2026-09-04T01:45:00Z',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'run_ingest_shear_20260903'),

('f_shear_052','m_shear','What corroborates that account is text inside its own images, not the handle. The alt text of the pinned first post reads: "I''m Emmett Shear. Co-founded Twitch, served as interim CEO of OpenAI. This is my official account. Starting a new chapter focused on the future of AI." The other three read "#ai", "Some things take time. This is one of them." and "Building for the long term. Focusing on the next frontier of AI at Softmax." Eleven followers against 123,009 on X: it is a claimed account, not a used one.','self_published','subject_authored','https://www.instagram.com/emmettshear/','instagram.com','2026-09-04','2026-09-04T01:45:00Z',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'run_ingest_shear_20260903'),

